online_order:
 'RATED
  A decent hide out - they have got a lounge too;
It is perfect place for friend parties and couples hide out;
They have buffet dinner as well as al-la-carte 
Do not expect world class service etc - but food is very good and we loved it;
They have got couple of beers and hard drinks.. Interestingly it does not looks to be so from outside. I do not say its bad place - though washrooms etc really need some house keeping; Over all more than average - good and taste food;
I did not try the dinner and hence cannot comment on it as of now.')

